Code adapted from other projects
--------------------------------

This project includes code adapted from Mailoo
(https://github.com/Bitfloo/mailoo, commit f537225),
Copyright (c) 2026 Bitfloo, licensed under LGPL-3.0-or-later.

The adapted files are:

  src/utils/loopback.ts                      loopback host check
  src/utils/loopback.test.ts                 tests for the above
  src/config/schema.ts                       plain-text login guard (the
                                             superRefine on AccountConfigSchema)
  src/connections/credential-redaction.ts    credential redaction in error text
  src/connections/credential-redaction.test.ts
  src/mcp-catalog.test.ts                    tool catalog baseline test (approach;
                                             the baseline data is original)
  src/safety/local-paths.ts                  protected local write locations (idea
                                             and rules; code is rewritten)
  src/safety/local-paths.test.ts             tests for the above
  src/services/protected-mailboxes.ts        folders delete/rename refuse (plus a
                                             common-name fallback added here)
  src/safety/untrusted-content.ts            untrusted-text markers (notice line and
                                             single-pass escaping added here)
  src/services/mailbox-lock.ts               bounded mailbox lock wait (closing the
                                             stuck connection is added here)
  src/tools/toolsets.ts                      toolset grouping idea (tool lists
                                             and filter are original)
  src/tools/export.tool.ts                   export_email tool (idea and shape;
                                             the file writer is original)
  src/services/outgoing-attachments.ts       attach local files by path (the read
                                             guard it calls is original)
  src/services/outgoing-attachments.test.ts  tests for the above
  src/tools/schema-helpers.ts                shared tool input schema pieces and
                                             the dryRun parameter
  src/safety/writer-lease.ts                 one background writer per machine
                                             (adds a lock-less fallback)
  src/safety/writer-lease.test.ts            tests for the above
  src/utils/file-claim.ts                    lock-file claim (adds the host and
                                             process id check for a dead holder)
  src/utils/file-claim.test.ts               tests for the above
  src/services/sieve.service.ts              ManageSieve client (socket reader,
                                             byte budget, deadlines, PLAIN login;
                                             literal-aware responses, CHECKSCRIPT,
                                             implicit TLS and OAuth added here)
  src/services/sieve.service.protocol.test.ts
                                             socket-level tests for the above

